@page "/van-sales/reports/sales-breakdown"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Manager")]

@* The desktop sales breakdown, for the vans alone. The page is DesktopSalesReport's; it asks the van sales
   analysis instead, which reads online van sales too — those never become desktop sales, so the desktop
   analysis confined to vans would leave out every sale a van made with signal. The roles are the other van
   reports', not the desktop page's: a cashier has no van reports. *@
<DesktopSalesReport Vans="true" />
